Still: bundle local blocked-site controls as an ordinary signed MV3 extension.

Use Chromium's existing CRX installer and first-profile preinstall decision.
Existing installs receive bundled-version updates; user removal is respected.
The extension has only DNR + storage permissions, a normal toolbar action and
options page. No component privileges, uBlock edits, verifier changes, or
security flag changes. Copy validated package assets before applying this patch
with still/blocking/copy-into-source.py.

diff --git a/chrome/browser/extensions/external_provider_impl.cc b/chrome/browser/extensions/external_provider_impl.cc
--- a/chrome/browser/extensions/external_provider_impl.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/extensions/external_provider_impl.cc
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@
 #include "base/logging.h"
